# --- Kernel campaign isolation (see CLAUDE.md) ---
# Campaign kernel code, harness, configs, docs, and results live in standalone
# /tmp/<slug>/ git repos. This agent repo keeps ONLY the directory structure via
# .gitkeep placeholders — never the actual content.
campaigns/operators/*/**
!campaigns/operators/*/**/
!campaigns/operators/**/.gitkeep
